{"articleNo":"650","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=650&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 1학기 근로장학생 신청안내(최종)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.02.17","hit":"20237","attachments":[{"name":"근로장학생신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=650&attachNo=69369"},{"name":"근로장학배정요청서-전체.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=650&attachNo=69370"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><strong>2009학년도 1학기 근로장학생 신청안내</strong></font></span></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\"></font></span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 목&nbsp; 적</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;학비 마련이 곤란하고 품행이 방정한 자로서 일정한 근로를 제공하고 그 대가</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;로 장학금을 지급함으로써&nbsp;학비부담을 경감시키고 면학분위기를 조성함에있음.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 근로장학생 업무 및 근무무서 : 첨부파일참조</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<u><strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">- 근로부서 이중신청 불가능</font></strong></u></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><strong><u><font face=\"굴림체\"><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\">(ex: 국가근로부서신청학생이 대학근로부서신청은 가능함)</span></font></font></u></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><strong><u><font face=\"굴림체\" color=\"#ff0000\"></font></u></strong></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 근로장학생 복무</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">근로기간 : 2009년 3월 1일 ~ 2009년 8월 31일</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 4개월 근무시 : 2009년 3월 1일 ~ 종강일까지</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">근로시간 : 1일 3시간 이내(주 15시간 이내)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">(단, 도서관, 정보전산원, 학생회관식당에 토요일, 일요일 근로하는</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;장학생의 근로시간은 예외로 함)</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 근로장학금 지급기준</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 국가근로장학금 : </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">시간당 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">6,500원</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\"> <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (창업진흥센터 입주업체 : </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">시간당 9,000원</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 대학근로장학금 : 노동부고시 최저 임금시급단가 적용</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">육체적노동 근로장학생</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\"> : 시간당 4,400원 (식당 식기세척, 분식보조)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;기타근로장학생 : </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">시간당 4,000원 (일반 행정업무보조)</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 근로장학생 선정 기준</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1순위 : 기초생활수급자 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (수급자증명서 제출 : 수급자발급명의 부.모.본인가능)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2순위 : 차상위계층 및 의료급여수급자 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (차상위계층확인서 및 의료급여수급자 제출)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3순위 : 건강보험료 납부금액이 전국 평균 이하인 자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (건강보험증 및 부.모건강보험납부확인서)-최근3개월이내납부확인서</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 51.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -51.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ ’07년도 건강보험료 평균 납입금액(국민건강보험공단) </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt s