체\">\n</font><p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;위 순위에 따라 신청 학생이 배정된 인원을 초과할 경우에는&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">학교성적 및 근</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;로&nbsp;해당부서의</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;자격요건을 갖춘학생 순으로 선발한다. (필요자격증제출가능)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#dc143c\"><strong><u>- 근로장학신청시 1~5순위 서류중 1개는 필수적으로 제출해야함&nbsp;</u></strong></font></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 근로장학생 신청기간 : </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">2009년 2월 20일(금) ~ 2월 24(화)까지 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (토,일 신청불가)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><br><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;7. 근로장학생 제출서류</font></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 근로장학생신청서 1부 - 전체 [첨부파일]</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 기초생활수급자 증명서 1부 (최근 1개월이내 발급분) </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 수급자명의 부,모 본인가능) - 해당자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 차창위계층 및 의료급여수급자 증명서 1부 - 해당자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 정부보증학자금대출 내역 1부 - 해당자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 건강보험증사본 및 부,모 건강보험납부확인서 각 1부 -&nbsp;해당자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;최근 3개월이내납부확인서&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 기타 근로부서관련 자격증 및 어학성적표 1부 - 해당자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;8. 근로장학신청서 및 서류제출장소 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>&nbsp;가. 국가근로장학생</strong></font> </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\" color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>-&nbsp;도서관 : 도서관 106호 (054-478-7164) </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\" color=\"#0000ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 정보전산원 : 도서관 412호 (054-478-7183)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\" color=\"#0000ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 테크노관